<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Two Column Layout</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: open sans;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
           
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(2, auto);
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .box {
            width: 550px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: #4F3674;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top-left-radius: 5px;
            border-top-right-radius: 5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 15px;
          font-size: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="title">Agenda Using CSS not created by Brett</div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="box">
            <div class="header">Weekly Agenda</div>
            <div class="content"><ul>
                     <li>Syllabus & Institutional Acknowledgment.</li>
                    <li>Weekly Introduction.</li>
                    <li>Weekly Readings & Course Materials.</li>
   <li>Week 1 Discussion Board - .</li>
                    <li>Week 1 Discussion Board - .</li>
                    <li>Week 1 Individual Assignment - .</li>
  
                </ul></div>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
            <div class="header">Action Oriented Learning Objectives</div>
            <div class="content"><p>Study the objectives below and reflect on the skills you will be able to demonstrate after executing the work this week!</p>
           
              <ul>
                        <li>Insert.</li>
<li>Insert.</li>
<li>Insert.</li>
                    </ul></div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</body>
</html>
